{"id":"8ee467bd1d472e5f","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Sound Premouse","display":"df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse — ZFC Inner4 Sound Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse — ZFC Inner4 Sound Premouse","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse — ZFC Inner4 Sound Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse\">58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,n\\in V\">\\(M,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse\">58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\\in\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span> (the definable proper class of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_n^M\">\\(\\rho_n^M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_n^M\">\\(p_n^M\\)</span> are the standard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-projectum and standard parameter of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hull}_n^M(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hull}_n^M(A)\\)</span> is the closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> under the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\Sigma_n^M\">\\(r\\Sigma_n^M\\)</span> Skolem functions</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sound\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S(M,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\vec E\\in V\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land M=\\langle J_\\alpha^{\\vec E},\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\rho_n^M\\in\\alpha+1\n\\land p_n^M\\in[\\alpha]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}=\\mathrm{Hull}_n^M\\bigl(\\rho_n^M\\cup\\{p_n^M\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sound\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S(M,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\vec E\\in V\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land M=\\langle J_\\alpha^{\\vec E},\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\rho_n^M\\in\\alpha+1\n\\land p_n^M\\in[\\alpha]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}=\\mathrm{Hull}_n^M\\bigl(\\rho_n^M\\cup\\{p_n^M\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hull equation recovers the premouse carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}\">\\(J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}\\)</span>, not the ordered triple that codes the whole premouse. The projectum may equal the premouse height, hence the bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_n^M\\in\\alpha+1\">\\(\\rho_n^M\\in\\alpha+1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}\\in\\mathsf{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_n^M","display":false},{"tex":"p_n^M","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hull}_n^M(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"r\\Sigma_n^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}sound\\text{-}premouse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4SoundPremouse}_S(M,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\vec E\\in V\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E)\n\\land M=\\langle J_\\alpha^{\\vec E},\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land\\rho_n^M\\in\\alpha+1\n\\land p_n^M\\in[\\alpha]^{<\\omega}\n\\land J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}=\\mathrm{Hull}_n^M\\bigl(\\rho_n^M\\cup\\{p_n^M\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_n^M\\in\\alpha+1","display":false}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"b78f1aa00040ca7f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2389","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse.md|58-df-zfc-inner4-sound-premouse]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ab819650b6d5d52d"]}